  "body_html": "<h1>Knapsack Auction Environment</h1>\n<p>A knapsack auction is a single-parameter mechanism equipped with public item\nweights and a total capacity constraint.</p>\n<p>The interface records the public item sizes, the capacity, weight and capacity\nsign assumptions, feasibility, and capacity-respecting allocation rules.</p>",
